    "$description": "The mark of the selected or current item in a list, a tree or a navigation menu: a short bar at the start, centered on the item. thickness 0 draws no bar (the language marks a selection with the item fill instead).",
    "$type": "dimension",
    "thickness": {
      "$value": {
        "value": 0,
        "unit": "px"
